    intro: 'The next afternoon, Natsumi brings the team to entertainment lawyer Ms. Hayashi. She explains that Apex would control the covered master recordings for an extended period. An advance is money paid upfront against future royalties. Under this proposal, further recording royalties would wait until specified costs were recovered. Kai realises that the headline payment does not explain the whole deal.',
